1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,140
Part thirteen. Buying material.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:08,974
Open Purchase, then Vendors, and add your supplier.

3
00:00:08,974 --> 00:00:13,327
Type the GSTIN and the state is filled from it,

4
00:00:13,327 --> 00:00:18,051
which decides CGST and SGST or IGST on your orders.

5
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:20,622
Now a purchase order.

6
00:00:20,622 --> 00:00:23,691
Choose the vendor and add the products.

7
00:00:23,691 --> 00:00:27,783
Lines use your purchase cost, never your sale price.

8
00:00:27,783 --> 00:00:30,616
Set it to Ordered, save and send it.

9
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:36,471
When the truck arrives, tap Receive goods and type what actually came.

10
00:00:36,471 --> 00:00:42,329
Part deliveries are fine: the order shows Partially Received and what is still due.

11
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:46,805
To pay the vendor, tap Record supplier payment.

12
00:00:46,805 --> 00:00:51,930
The amount still to pay is filled in; change it for a part payment,

13
00:00:51,930 --> 00:00:54,836
choose the mode and the UTR, and save.

14
00:00:54,836 --> 00:00:57,743
The order shows paid and still to pay.

15
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:03,808
Next video: Installation: checklist, photos and certificate.

